OL,3,AGerard Depardieu drops appeal against
OL,4,Asexual assault conviction
OL,5,
OL,6,FFrench film star Gerard Depardieu has
OL,7,Fdropped his appeal against a conviction
OL,8,Ffor sexual assault, admitting that his
OL,9,Fbehaviour towards women had often been
OL,10,Foffensive and offering a "deep and
OL,11,Fsincere" apology.
OL,13,FOn the day that the appeal was due to
OL,14,Fstart in a Paris court, the 77-year-old
OL,15,Factor's unexpected mea culpa marks a
OL,16,Fdramatic reversal of his previous
OL,17,Fdenials of sexual impropriety.
OL,19,F"Justice was pronounced. I was found
OL,20,Fguilty. I understand and bow to this
OL,21,Fconviction... I have therefore decided
OL,22,Fto abandon the appeal," he wrote.
OL,23,APub: 16-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBCultureC Nat RadioFTechnology
