OL,3,AGerard Depardieu drops appeal against
OL,4,Asexual assault conviction
OL,5,
OL,6,FIt means he is now guilty in law of
OL,7,Fabusing two women during a film shoot
OL,8,Fin Paris five years ago, and his
OL,9,F18-month suspended prison term stands.
